{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 16:48:03.503394", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Overview:\\nThe network is a 4-tier data center Clos topology using EBGP for routing. It includes DNS servers, web servers, and external client hosts. The reachability test results indicate that there are issues with connectivity between hosts in the network.\\n\\n#### Findings:\\n1. **Reachability Test Results**:\\n   - **Client to Web Server (`client_0` to `webserver0_pod0`)**:\\n     - Status: Unknown\\n     - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or round-trip time (RTT).\\n   - **DNS Server to Web Server (`dns_pod0` to `webserver0_pod0`)**:\\n     - Status: Unknown\\n     - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or RTT.\\n   - **DNS Server to Client (`dns_pod0` to `client_0`)**:\\n     - Status: Unknown\\n     - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or RTT.\\n   - **Web Server to Client (`webserver0_pod0` to `client_0`)**:\\n     - Status: Unknown\\n     - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or RTT.\\n\\n2. **Connectivity Issues**:\\n   - All reachability tests between the hosts resulted in an \"unknown\" status, indicating potential issues with the network\\'s routing or host configurations.\\n   - Lack of transmitted and received packet data suggests that the network may not be forwarding traffic correctly.\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nTo further diagnose the root cause of the connectivity issues, I will investigate:\\n- The network configurations of the hosts and routers.\\n- The BGP routing tables and configurations on the routers.\\n- The status of services running on the hosts (DNS and HTTP servers).\\n- The physical and logical connectivity between devices.\\n\\nThis report highlights the presence of anomalies in the network, specifically the inability of hosts to communicate. Further analysis is required to pinpoint the faulty devices and identify the root cause., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='010d66ed-3b3a-4dfc-8ba7-de13a646558e'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
